     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>tower</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce80" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Er is *te veel politie* om een ​​cypher te starten!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>When you try to start a character select cypher, but there is police after you so it doesn’t work</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
