     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>tower</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce80" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Wil je switchen?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>When a cypher is active and you talk to one of the characters, they ask if you want to switch out (be aware this can be anoybody so keep very generic)</text:p>
