     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce80" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T1">DOT EXE</text:span> zijn *cyberhead b-boys *, de meesters van *Millennium Winkelcentrum*.</text:p>
